\section{Appendix: Sentivity Test - Single Model Regressions}
\label{sec:app_sensitivty_regress}

Here we present sensitivity tests where $\beta_c$ and $\beta_i$ are estimated using observations from a single ESM, rather than pooling all models. Instead of estimating Equation $\eqref{eq:regression}$, we have: 



